      "message": "rpc: Describe all types of a param in OpenRPC\n\ngetopenrpcinfo builds the schema of a parameter from its first type\nonly, so a parameter that takes an options object or a boolean would be\ndescribed as an object. Describe it with a oneOf holding one schema per\ndeclared type.",
